WEBVTT

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.560
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:11.690
So far on Aikatsu Stars!

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:15.770
The Aikatsu Ranking Final Tournament is finally under way.

00:00:15.770 --> 00:00:19.200
Elza-san and I made it to the Final Stage.

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:25.420
Her performance at the Final Stage was overwhelming, and entranced everyone who saw it.

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:27.520
She was as amazing as ever.

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:31.180
And now, it's time for me to take the stage.

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:35.430
As expected of Elza Forte-san!

00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:40.560
She showed us the greatest performance thus far!

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:44.310
Following her will be Nijino Yume-san!

00:00:44.630 --> 00:00:48.460
What kind of powerful performance will she put on?

00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:51.190
I'm trembling with excitement!

00:00:51.190 --> 00:00:53.250
Are you nervous, Yume?

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:55.450
Rola.

00:00:57.700 --> 00:00:59.740
Just do what you always do.

00:01:00.130 --> 00:01:01.870
Go out there and have a blast.

00:01:02.990 --> 00:01:04.190
She's right.

00:01:05.590 --> 00:01:08.080
Koharu-chan! You all...

00:01:08.630 --> 00:01:11.130
I know you can win!

00:01:11.130 --> 00:01:13.880
We're all here for you.

00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:17.640
Won't you make that Elza Forte say "uncle" for us?

00:01:17.640 --> 00:01:20.010
Let it all kabloom!

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:23.890
Allow your feelings to erupt upon the stage!

00:01:25.890 --> 00:01:31.900
I will! I'll use this performance to shine with everyone!

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:51.090
Here we go!

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:55.180
Aikatsu!

00:03:39.070 --> 00:03:40.220
Elza-san...

00:03:42.220 --> 00:03:43.690
Yume Nijino.

00:03:45.880 --> 00:03:48.850
That was a lovely performance, Elza-san.

00:03:48.850 --> 00:03:49.710
Thanks.

00:03:50.850 --> 00:03:54.770
I always used to think you were incredible.

00:03:54.770 --> 00:03:57.500
Even now, I still feel the same.

00:03:58.650 --> 00:03:59.880
Perfect.

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:05.260
There's no better word to describe you in the Sun Dress.

00:04:08.110 --> 00:04:12.140
Is it true that you plan to quit being an idol if you win?

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:15.900
That has nothing to do with you.

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:17.770
I won't lose.

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:23.360
Where does your confidence come from?

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:25.040
I'm not confident.

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:30.540
But right now, there's one thing I have that you can't match.

00:04:30.980 --> 00:04:32.660
That I can't match?

00:04:33.140 --> 00:04:34.300
My feelings.

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:43.150
Throughout all my Aikatsu, I've devoted myself to shining alongside all the people who've gotten me this far.

00:04:45.290 --> 00:04:47.170
How very like you.

00:04:47.170 --> 00:04:49.460
But let me say this—

00:04:49.460 --> 00:04:54.090
A perfect idol does not shine with others under any circumstances.

00:04:54.090 --> 00:04:56.120
She glimmers all on her own.

00:04:56.120 --> 00:04:58.520
My feelings go beyond that.

00:04:59.780 --> 00:05:05.860
I want all of us idols to become the bright light that can make the hearts of everyone around us shine.

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:11.020
The teachers who are always guiding us.

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:16.370
Yume-chan

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:16.370
Yume-chan

00:05:12.310 --> 00:05:15.670
The fans who are always cheering me on.

00:05:16.930 --> 00:05:21.620
All these people helped build the stage I'll stand on today.

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:29.680
That's why I want to ignite a light in the hearts of everyone watching today.

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:33.810
This strong emotion won't lose to you!

00:05:35.010 --> 00:05:37.400
Those are my feelings.

00:05:38.540 --> 00:05:41.960
I see. I understand your feelings well.

00:05:43.200 --> 00:05:44.980
Now go prove it...

00:05:46.570 --> 00:05:48.990
...on the stage.

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:58.080
Are you ready to bring it home?

00:05:58.160 --> 00:06:03.460
With the honor of closing out the Final Stage, from Four Star Academy's one and only S4,

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:07.850
it's Nijino Yume-san!

00:06:06.430 --> 00:06:07.850
It's finally time.

00:06:08.880 --> 00:06:10.140
I'm so nervous!

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:13.210
Me too. Even more than for my own day.

00:06:13.880 --> 00:06:16.480
Rola, what are you doing?

00:06:17.800 --> 00:06:19.350
A trick to calm down.

00:06:19.350 --> 00:06:22.920
And what's the point of <i>you</i> doing that?

00:06:22.920 --> 00:06:27.740
This is exactly the kind of situation when a true friend should believe in her without fear.

00:06:28.600 --> 00:06:30.490
Your arms are shaking.

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:32.810
O-Out of excitement, I assure you!

00:06:32.810 --> 00:06:34.140
You don't need to worry.

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:40.120
Back when we saw Yume-chan off, I could see fighting spirit burning in her eyes.{zerg only, no map settings, fighting spirit}

00:06:40.440 --> 00:06:43.880
Those with a fire will never lose!

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:46.430
There's a Yuzu proverb if I've ever heard one.

00:06:51.320 --> 00:06:52.500
<i>You can do this.</i>

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:56.710
<i>Believe in yourself, Yume.</i>

00:06:57.450 --> 00:07:01.140
<i>I may not be able to match Elza-san directly right now.</i>

00:07:01.790 --> 00:07:02.670
<i>Even so...</i>

00:07:04.310 --> 00:07:07.850
<i>I think MUSIC of DREAM!!! would be perfect.</i>

00:07:07.850 --> 00:07:11.290
<i>I want to see you like that again.</i>

00:07:11.290 --> 00:07:14.380
<i>Go out and shine with our Star Wings!</i>

00:07:14.380 --> 00:07:17.420
<i>You should don it with confidence.</i>

00:07:17.420 --> 00:07:22.870
<i>If you can master the Elza Killer Step I'm about to show you, you've got this in the bag!</i>

00:07:22.870 --> 00:07:26.240
<i>Yume, I know you can do it.</i>

00:07:27.060 --> 00:07:30.650
<i>Let's see, if you want to win...</i>

00:07:32.540 --> 00:07:34.520
<i>I have my friends!</i>

00:07:37.740 --> 00:07:40.850
<i>With everyone by my side, I can't be beat!</i>

00:07:41.650 --> 00:07:44.360
<i>I'll shine with everyone!</i>

00:07:44.830 --> 00:07:47.900
Nijino Yume, ready to go!

00:08:10.810 --> 00:08:12.880
Dresses can make everyone shine!

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:03.260
Isn't that the Sun Dress?

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:04.510
No way...

00:11:05.070 --> 00:11:06.690
Is this real?

00:11:06.690 --> 00:11:09.270
Amazing, Yume... you get me going!

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:14.560
There can be no doubt! That is without question the Sun Dress!

00:11:14.560 --> 00:11:18.280
See? That's why I said Yume-chan would be just fine!

00:11:19.750 --> 00:11:22.670
What a dress... it's beautiful.

00:11:22.670 --> 00:11:27.000
And it's not just the dress that's radiant, it's Yume!

00:11:32.070 --> 00:11:33.900
<i>It can't be...</i>

00:11:33.900 --> 00:11:36.980
<i>Why did the Sun Dress...</i>

00:11:39.580 --> 00:11:40.550
Yume!

00:11:41.960 --> 00:11:43.450
Girls!

00:11:43.450 --> 00:11:45.800
That was an amazing performance, Yume!

00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:48.850
I can't believe you actually got the Sun Dress—

00:11:48.190 --> 00:11:50.060
Yume!

00:11:50.390 --> 00:11:53.710
That was the best!

00:11:53.710 --> 00:11:56.560
Ako-chan, it's too early to cry.

00:11:56.560 --> 00:11:59.820
Yes, at least wait until the results come in.

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:06.450
Although, I must admit that she was so fantastic I couldn't care less about the outcome.

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:09.810
Thank you! I couldn't have done it without you all!

00:12:09.810 --> 00:12:11.960
Yume!

00:12:22.310 --> 00:12:25.890
The last votes for the Final Tournament have been tallied!

00:12:26.370 --> 00:12:29.430
Who will triumph in the Aikatsu Tournament?

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:32.810
Will it be the perfect idol, Elza Forte-san?

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:37.560
Or will it be the shining star, Nijino Yume-san?!

00:12:37.560 --> 00:12:41.240
The voice of the people says...

00:13:14.120 --> 00:13:16.420
Oh my!

00:13:16.420 --> 00:13:21.500
The victor is Nijino Yume-san!

00:13:24.500 --> 00:13:26.160
A hair's breadth victory!

00:13:26.530 --> 00:13:31.460
This passionate battle for the top was guaranteed to be close,

00:13:31.460 --> 00:13:36.330
but Nijino Yume-san was the one to grasp victory!

00:13:45.350 --> 00:13:46.490
Elza-san!

00:13:51.850 --> 00:13:54.170
Congratulations, Yume Nijino.

00:13:54.170 --> 00:13:55.980
Your performance was magnificent.

00:13:55.980 --> 00:14:03.240
Elza-san, when I said I wanted to make everyone's hearts shine, I meant you too.

00:14:04.840 --> 00:14:06.740
Everyone in this stadium,

00:14:06.740 --> 00:14:10.780
all of the idols I love, and you as well.

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:13.270
I want to shine with <i>everyone</i>!

00:14:14.060 --> 00:14:15.080
So please...

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:18.520
Please don't quit being an idol!

00:14:25.170 --> 00:14:28.300
I see. Now I get it.

00:14:29.330 --> 00:14:32.410
I ended up losing to those feelings.

00:14:33.010 --> 00:14:35.080
Because I don't share them...

00:14:35.910 --> 00:14:38.810
An emotion... as strong...

00:14:39.660 --> 00:14:40.640
Elza.

00:14:47.030 --> 00:14:48.780
Mother...

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:51.660
Even you three...

00:14:52.040 --> 00:14:53.910
Why are you here?

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:56.800
I came to see your performance.

00:14:56.800 --> 00:14:59.580
I'm sorry for being late.

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:02.840
Don't be, I didn't...

00:15:03.470 --> 00:15:08.590
In any case, please forgive me. You came all this way...

00:15:08.590 --> 00:15:12.590
Yet I... lost.

00:15:13.460 --> 00:15:18.460
I've done something so shameful in front of you...

00:15:18.460 --> 00:15:20.100
I'm so—

00:15:25.720 --> 00:15:27.070
Mother...

00:15:28.100 --> 00:15:31.270
I'm the one who needs to apologize, Elza.

00:15:31.960 --> 00:15:36.480
I can't believe I've never been able to do something this simple for you.

00:15:36.480 --> 00:15:38.260
I'm a terrible mother.

00:15:43.150 --> 00:15:49.550
Mother... I always wanted to be like you.

00:15:51.190 --> 00:15:52.150
But...

00:15:53.510 --> 00:15:54.330
I couldn't—

00:15:54.330 --> 00:15:58.410
Elza, the only person you need to be like is yourself.

00:15:58.410 --> 00:16:02.500
I thought your performance was just lovely.

00:16:03.420 --> 00:16:06.000
To me...

00:16:06.000 --> 00:16:08.090
You're a perfect daughter.

00:16:11.310 --> 00:16:19.370
I may have lost, but I'm so happy you were here to see me sing my heart out.

00:16:20.750 --> 00:16:23.120
What a beautiful ending!

00:16:24.200 --> 00:16:25.230
Elza...

00:16:27.510 --> 00:16:31.630
By the way, I had quite the ordeal getting here.

00:16:32.880 --> 00:16:34.800
Listen to this!

00:16:36.800 --> 00:16:37.920
Yes?

00:16:38.580 --> 00:16:39.350
Oh.

00:16:39.790 --> 00:16:41.400
You girls...

00:16:43.310 --> 00:16:44.840
We have something to tell you.

00:16:45.430 --> 00:16:46.900
And what is that?

00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:48.850
Please forgive our rudeness.

00:16:48.850 --> 00:16:49.780
Kirara!

00:16:49.780 --> 00:16:52.190
Do it, Carol-tan!

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:03.180
Care to explain?

00:17:03.180 --> 00:17:05.920
Sorry, but we have a request.

00:17:05.920 --> 00:17:09.170
Please come to see Elza's performance at once!

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:11.050
Um, but...

00:17:11.050 --> 00:17:12.920
If you won't come...

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:16.530
Carol-tan's gonna eat all of these documents!

00:17:18.140 --> 00:17:19.690
Is that what you want?

00:17:20.290 --> 00:17:22.720
Is that <i>really</i> what you want?

00:17:23.780 --> 00:17:26.050
N-No...

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:29.510
Can you believe it?

00:17:30.730 --> 00:17:34.270
Girls, what have you done to my mother?

00:17:35.940 --> 00:17:37.610
I'm quite relieved.

00:17:37.610 --> 00:17:41.780
You've made some wonderful friends.

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:49.420
Venus Ark will close down.

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:53.480
I no longer have need of anyone.

00:17:53.480 --> 00:17:56.010
Just leave me alone.

00:17:56.010 --> 00:17:58.450
What do you think you know about me?

00:17:58.450 --> 00:17:59.680
Leave me.

00:18:03.640 --> 00:18:08.140
I've only been thinking about myself...

00:18:08.140 --> 00:18:14.900
I only cared about the Sun Dress and how to be perfect, but what I've done to you in the process...

00:18:15.630 --> 00:18:19.340
The one who hasn't accomplished anything is me.

00:18:19.340 --> 00:18:20.620
That's not true.

00:18:22.560 --> 00:18:27.910
The entire reason I'm here now is none other than you, Elza.

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:33.600
You opened the door to the world of idols for me.

00:18:34.130 --> 00:18:35.410
Rei...

00:18:35.410 --> 00:18:37.380
The same goes for Kirara!

00:18:37.690 --> 00:18:45.200
If I hadn't met you, I'd probably still be floating through life with Carol-tan.

00:18:46.020 --> 00:18:52.900
I don't regret becoming an idol and finding new excitement every day even one bit!

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:54.400
Kirara...

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:56.940
She's right, that's exactly it!

00:18:56.940 --> 00:19:04.330
If we'd never met, I wouldn't have learned how much fun different Aikatsu could be.

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:09.250
I'm so happy right now! So very happy.

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:12.290
Aria, even you...

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:18.240
Honestly, you girls...

00:19:18.240 --> 00:19:19.760
Elza...

00:19:22.540 --> 00:19:24.410
You're far too splendid.

00:19:26.260 --> 00:19:27.560
Elza-sama!

00:19:27.560 --> 00:19:28.400
Elza-san!

00:19:28.400 --> 00:19:29.230
Elza!

00:19:29.230 --> 00:19:31.030
You're crying, Elza-sama!

00:19:34.520 --> 00:19:38.370
Yes, what an unexpected win! Yeah!

00:19:38.370 --> 00:19:40.240
You did so well!

00:19:39.130 --> 00:19:41.150
<i>Excuse</i> me, Headmaster?

00:19:42.430 --> 00:19:45.250
Did you really think that Yume-chan would lose?

00:19:45.250 --> 00:19:46.540
Hime-kun...

00:19:46.970 --> 00:19:48.900
Of course not.

00:19:48.900 --> 00:19:53.970
Even against Elza Forte, I believe in Yume-kun...

00:19:53.970 --> 00:19:55.580
more than anyone.

00:19:55.580 --> 00:19:56.890
Oh, really?

00:19:58.060 --> 00:20:01.450
That said, Yume-chan may have won this time,

00:20:01.450 --> 00:20:06.540
but in doing so, she must have inspired countless others to do their best.

00:20:06.540 --> 00:20:07.810
So next time...

00:20:09.640 --> 00:20:11.320
I wonder who'll win.

00:20:11.320 --> 00:20:14.340
One way or another, we're sure to double our school's applicants!

00:20:14.340 --> 00:20:16.320
Or maybe even triple or quadruple!

00:20:21.860 --> 00:20:23.660
Cheers!

00:20:24.410 --> 00:20:26.820
Yume, congratulations on winning.

00:20:26.820 --> 00:20:30.790
Thank you. I couldn't have done it without everyone's help.

00:20:30.790 --> 00:20:33.790
You've got that right! I want to hear some gratitude.

00:20:33.790 --> 00:20:37.540
Is that something you should say after 
bawling your eyes out when Yume won?

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:39.070
I-I didn't!

00:20:39.070 --> 00:20:40.420
Ako-chan, you're so cute.

00:20:40.800 --> 00:20:43.290
But really, thank you.

00:20:43.290 --> 00:20:46.180
I definitely couldn't have done it alone.

00:20:46.180 --> 00:20:48.680
You're the one who worked the hardest.

00:20:48.680 --> 00:20:52.910
That's right. Even the Aikatsu System acknowledged you.

00:20:52.910 --> 00:20:53.940
Yeah!

00:20:53.940 --> 00:20:55.690
Girls...

00:20:55.690 --> 00:20:59.190
I hate to interrupt such a thoughtful moment,

00:20:59.190 --> 00:21:03.700
but I hope you haven't forgotten that the S4 Selection is right around the corner.

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:05.410
The S4 Selection...

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:08.950
That's right, we'll be third-years soon...

00:21:13.870 --> 00:21:16.170
It's already been a year.

00:21:16.170 --> 00:21:18.420
We can't relax for too long.

00:21:18.930 --> 00:21:21.920
It really is great to have a goal.

00:21:22.570 --> 00:21:26.500
There's no better motivation than having something to reach.

00:21:26.500 --> 00:21:27.470
Yeah!

00:21:27.470 --> 00:21:28.800
You said it.

00:21:45.880 --> 00:21:49.100
I lost completely, Yume Nijino.{I considered "you destroyed me"}

00:21:50.470 --> 00:21:53.330
Is it true that you plan to quit being an idol?

00:21:54.820 --> 00:21:55.890
An idol...

00:21:58.410 --> 00:22:00.880
From now on, what should I...

00:22:05.860 --> 00:22:06.630
Elza!

00:22:08.800 --> 00:22:10.600
I knew she'd be here!

00:22:10.600 --> 00:22:12.000
You three...

00:22:12.920 --> 00:22:16.190
Be careful or you'll catch a cold out here.

00:22:16.190 --> 00:22:18.000
Elza, put this on.

00:22:19.640 --> 00:22:20.770
Thank you.

00:23:55.910 --> 00:23:59.370
My Aikatsu is all about shining with everyone.

00:23:59.370 --> 00:24:02.750
I couldn't have become the world's best idol alone!

00:24:02.750 --> 00:24:06.960
Congrats on winning! Your Sun Dress looks amazing on you.

00:24:06.960 --> 00:24:09.960
I'm so happy we met!

00:24:10.970 --> 00:24:12.970
The boat's leaving!

00:24:12.970 --> 00:24:14.640
We have to say goodbye?

00:24:14.640 --> 00:24:16.260
Farewell, Japan.

00:24:16.600 --> 00:24:18.810
Venus Ark, set sail!

00:24:18.810 --> 00:24:20.850
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:20.850 --> 00:24:22.100
Bon Bon Voyage!{where have we seen this before}

00:24:22.100 --> 00:24:24.520
Become the first-star idol!
